       "zh": "你家有几口人？",
       "py": "Nǐ jiā yǒu jǐ kǒu rén?",
       "en": "How many people are in your family?"
      },
      {
       "name": "大卫",
       "zh": "我家有四口人，爸爸、妈妈、姐姐和我。",
       "py": "Wǒ jiā yǒu sì kǒu rén, bàba, māma, jiějie hé wǒ.",
       "en": "There are four people in my family: my dad, my mom, my older sister, and me."
      },
